esident who has been Akihisa's friend and partner-in-crime since the freshman year.\n\nThe school happens to have developed experiments to summon fantasy creatures, and Akihisa decides to rally F class to take on the higher-tiered classes and seize their perks. The F class uses the summoned creatures in an all-out battle for school supremacy."},"tags":[{"name":"School","rank":99,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Surreal Comedy","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Meta","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Parody","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Chibi","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Femboy","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yandere","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Twins","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Baka and Test - Summon the Beasts","english":"Baka and Test - Summon the Beasts","native":"バカとテストと召喚獣","romaji":"Baka to Test to Shoukanjuu","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"笨蛋，测验，召唤兽"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"笨蛋测验召唤兽"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"笨蛋测试召唤兽"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"笨蛋，测试，召唤兽"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}